  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: EscapeFire.Runtime::EscapeFire.Lesson.LessonStation
  title: "2. Ch\u1ECDn \u0111\xFAng b\xECnh"
  explanation: "Ch\xE1y thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB \u0111i\u1EC7n: KH\xD4NG d\xF9ng n\u01B0\u1EDBc
    hay b\u1ECDt (d\u1EABn \u0111i\u1EC7n, g\xE2y gi\u1EADt). D\xF9ng b\xECnh CO2
    (ho\u1EB7c b\u1ED9t ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p) v\xE0 ng\u1EAFt \u0111i\u1EC7n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
    khi d\u1EADp."
  ruleId: R03_RIGHT_AGENT
  question: "T\u1EE7 server \u0111ang c\xF3 \u0111i\u1EC7n b\u1ED1c ch\xE1y. Vi\u1EC7c
    \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn n\xEAn l\xE0m l\xE0 g\xEC?"
  options:
  - "X\u1ECBt n\u01B0\u1EDBc ngay"
  - "Ng\u1EAFt Aptomat r\u1ED3i d\xF9ng CO2"
  - "M\u1EDF c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 cho tho\xE1ng"
  correctOption: 1
  whyCorrect: "Ng\u1EAFt ngu\u1ED3n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, r\u1ED3i d\xF9ng ch\u1EA5t ch\u1EEFa
    ch\xE1y kh\xF4ng d\u1EABn \u0111i\u1EC7n."
